node_modules/
out/
*.vsix
# package-lock.json is deliberately TRACKED (2026-07-27 security triage).
# This extension ships to end users, and an ignored lockfile means the
# published build is neither reproducible nor scannable -- no tool can
# tell which transitive versions a .vsix was built from. The line that
# used to ignore it was VS Code extension boilerplate, not a decision
# about this package.
